Pocket Sokoban contains separately licensed code and level data:

1. Movement and rewind in core.cpp/core.hpp are adapted from NibbleSokoban,
   Copyright (c) 2021 snsdosen, under the MIT License. The full original license
   is in upstream/NibbleSokoban/LICENSE and assets/LICENSE-NibbleSokoban.txt.
2. The selected generated Boxoban levels are distributed under Apache-2.0.
   The full license is in upstream/boxoban/LICENSE and assets/LICENSE-Boxoban.txt.
   The C++ string conversion does not alter the layouts. Original level IDs,
   repository revisions, file SHA-256, and changes are recorded in SOURCES.json.
3. Original tutorial layouts, UI, geometric artwork and icons, tests, and build
   glue are dedicated to the public domain under CC0-1.0. The complete legal
   code is in LICENSE-CC0.txt and assets/LICENSE-CC0.txt.

The original NibbleSokoban levels, sprites and bitmaps are not included.
All applicable licenses and attributions are copied into assets for signed
package redistribution. See assets/NOTICE.txt for source and citation details.
